Comments: [Evaluator: Christian Iliadis; Date: 05/25/2023]
1. See information for 25Mg(p,g)26Al_total rate.
2. Ground state branching fractions from Endt & Rolfs 1987, Iliadis diploma thesis, Strieder et al. 2012, Lotay et al. 2022, and Dermigny et al. 2016.
3. Direct capture: experimental C2S values as tabulated in Endt 1990, but also including Li et al. 2020 for low-lying levels. C2S for each state has been
   multiplied by ground state fraction from Endt & Rolfs 1987.
4. Er = 93 keV: f0 = 0.77(10) from weighted average of Champagne and Lotay et al. 2022; value listed in Endt & Rolfs for this level is disregarded, because
   it is inexplicable how it was estimated; 13% uncertainty on f0 is included in our overall factor 1.5 uncertainty for the strength.
